SUMMARY:You Can See Everything
LOCATION:Beacon Cinema\, 57 North St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:Times: 11:55am\, 6pm\nThirty-four days before she’s sent to p
 rison\, notorious Silicon Valley founder Elizabeth Holmes invites a skepti
 cal film crew to document her every move. What begins as an intimate portr
 ait of an enigmatic felon becomes a mind-bending three-year journey into t
 he abyss. From boundary-pushing directors Nathan Fielder and Lance Oppenhe
 im comes You Can See Everything.\nhttps://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/you
 -can-see-everything/HO00001794\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin
 .city/westernma/
URL:https://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/you-can-see-everything/HO00001794
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:73d1da01639838e227469e78a76f70e14cfd512d@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261114T153123Z
DTSTART:20261114T174000Z
DTEND:20261114T194000Z
SUMMARY:Wild Horse Nine
LOCATION:Beacon Cinema\, 57 North St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:Times: 12:40pm\, 3:10pm\, 5:40pm\, 8:10pm\nShortly before the 1
 973 Chilean coup\, CIA agents Chris (John Malkovich) and Lee (Sam Rockwell
 ) are dispatched from Santiago to Easter island by their bureau chief\, MJ
  (Steve Buscemi). Amongst the Island's iconic statues\, and as the longtim
 e partners wrestle with their dark pasts and present conspiracies\, Chris'
 s newfound bond with a pair of rebellious students (Mariana di Girolamo an
 d Ailín Salas) threatens to send everyone’s trip to this remote paradis
 e sideways.\nhttps://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/wild-horse-nine/HO000017
 95\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/wild-horse-nine/HO00001795
END:VEVENT
