 o\, and Godzilla plunged it into minus. Two years have passed since then\,
  and the country has faced agonizing struggles to achieve recovery and fin
 ally reclaim its daily life.\nhttps://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/godzill
 a-minus-zero/HO00001786\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/w
 esternma/
URL:https://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/godzilla-minus-zero/HO00001786
