BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:eb298a47b7a636c58810882daf2be14808beabbb@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261114T153123Z
DTSTART:20261114T202000Z
DTEND:20261114T222000Z
SUMMARY:Wildwood
LOCATION:Beacon Cinema\, 57 North St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:Times: 3:20pm\, 9:30pm\, 10:40pm\nWildwood is a handcrafted epi
 c fantasy that transports audiences into a secret\, dangerously alive worl
 d. A girl’s desperate quest to save her baby brother unfolds into a spec
 tacular\, high-stakes adventure through a forbidden forest full of enchant
 ed creatures\, endearing allies\, and formidable adversaries—where an en
 tire hidden realm hangs in the balance. In an era of automation\, LAIKA de
 livers its most ambitious and globally accessible film yet—a bold fusion
  of human-crafted artistry and cinematic storytelling from the makers of C
 oraline.\nhttps://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/wildwood/HO00001782\nFrom P
 ushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/wildwood/HO00001782
END:VEVENT
